# ---- Rust / Anchor ----
target/
**/target/
.anchor/
programs/*/target/
*.so
test-ledger/
.yarn/
cargo-*.lock

# ---- Node ----
node_modules/
.pnpm-store/
dist/
build/
.vite/
*.tsbuildinfo
coverage/
.vercel/
.netlify/

# ---- Secrets & local state ----
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.json.bak
keypairs/
**/keypair.json
# The program keypairs ARE committed, deliberately. A program's address is derived from its
# keypair and `declare_id!` is compiled into the program, so without these a fresh clone
# cannot build an artifact whose ID matches the source. See deploy-keys/README.md for why
# that is safe for these devnet keys and why mainnet must generate its own.
!deploy-keys/*-keypair.json

# ---- Traces generated locally ----
traces/local/
traces/*.tmp.json

# ---- Editors / OS ----
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
*.swp
